        <area aac="SA_FA001" description="South Australia" type="region">
            <forecast-period start-time-local="2026-08-08T09:36:41+09:30" end-time-local="2026-08-08T09:36:41+09:30" start-time-utc="2026-08-08T00:06:41Z" end-time-utc="2026-08-08T00:06:41Z">
                <text type="warning_summary_footer">For latest warnings go to www.bom.gov.au, subscribe to RSS feeds, call 1300 659 210* or listen for warnings on relevant TV and radio broadcasts.</text>
                <text type="synoptic_situation">A weak high pressure system centred over NSW and a cold front approaching from the west result in a northerly airstream over SA this morning. The vigorous cold front will move across the west late Saturday then moving across remaining parts of the State on Sunday. A high pressure system moves just to the north on Monday, ahead of another cold front forecast to move across South Australia on Tuesday.</text>
                <text type="product_footer">* Calls to 1300 numbers cost around 27.5c incl. GST, higher from mobiles or public phones.</text>
            </forecast-period>
        </area>
