                <text type="forecast">Cloudy. Very high chance of showers. Winds north to northeasterly 15 to 25 km/h. Daytime maximum temperatures around 16.</text>
                <text type="uv_alert">Sun protection 10:50am to 1:40pm, UV Index predicted to reach 3 [Moderate]</text>
